<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">09052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>American forces struck two Iranian tankers at the Strait of Hormuz, even as Pakistan delivered a Washington ceasefire memorandum to Tehran.</s> <s>The strait's been closed for seventy days now, choking off a fifth of the world's oil.</s> <s>Secretary of State Marco Rubio expects Iran's response by Friday... and President Trump's threatened wider strikes if it doesn't come.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's Bharatiya Janata Party took two hundred and nine of two hundred and ninety-four seats in West Bengal, ending fifteen years of Trinamool Congress rule.</s> <s>Suvendu Adhikari was sworn in as the state's first BJP chief minister, with Prime Minister Modi presiding over the ceremony.</s> <s>For Bengal's twenty-seven percent Muslim minority — the largest share in any major Indian state — the political ground has just shifted underfoot.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sudan recalled its ambassador to Addis Ababa after presenting drone evidence tying Ethiopia and the Emirates to a strike on a Khartoum commander's home that killed fifteen people.</s> <s>The Rapid Support Forces are now massing on the Sudan-Libya-Egypt border triangle, opening a second front toward Darfur.</s> <s>What began as a civil war is becoming a regional contest with named foreign sponsors.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ankara unveiled a six-thousand-kilometre ballistic missile called Yildirimhan, a road-mobile liquid-fuelled weapon ten years in development.</s> <s>Turkey's a NATO member that hosts American tactical nuclear weapons on its soil, and it's never fielded a missile of this class before.</s> <s>The signal is unmistakable... a Muslim-majority ally is preparing for a world where Washington's nuclear umbrella may not always hold.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazilian authorities say the First Capital Command laundered three hundred and twenty million dollars in drug proceeds through online raffles fronted by social-media influencers.</s> <s>Fake brand sponsorships were booked as ordinary creator-economy income, indistinguishable on paper from the real thing.</s> <s>Mexico and Colombia have opened parallel investigations, suggesting the template's already been copied across the region.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An American-Australian rare-earths processing deal will route radioactive thorium-bearing residue through the Lynas plant in Pahang, Malaysia.</s> <s>Critics call the geometry colonial in shape — the buyer in Washington, the miner in Perth, the tailings in Kuantan — with Putrajaya never given a real choice.</s> <s>So-called critical minerals supply chains, it turns out, are about who inherits the waste as much as who digs the ore.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China-Russia trade rose nearly twenty percent year-on-year through April, yet Russia's surplus held flat at nine and a half billion dollars.</s> <s>Moscow's selling more oil, gas, and coal at deeper discounts, settled in yuan rather than dollars, running faster to stay in the same place.</s> <s>For Brussels, the Eurasian payments rail is no longer hypothetical — it's the working prototype the digital euro was built to answer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Microsoft and the Emirati firm <sub alias="G forty-two">G42</sub> have pledged a billion dollars for a data centre in Naivasha, the Kenyan town that built East Africa's cut-flower export industry on identical incentives.</s> <s>Those flower farms became a billion-dollar export sector while paying poverty wages and draining Lake Naivasha.</s> <s>Activists warn the data racks will follow the same pattern — capital-intensive, foreign-owned, almost entirely extractive.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Poland overtook Switzerland this week to become the world's twentieth-largest economy, with per capita income climbing from six thousand seven hundred dollars in nineteen ninety to fifty-five thousand today.</s> <s>Warsaw's been invited as a guest to the Group of Twenty summit, though no guest has ever been promoted to full membership.</s> <s>Whether the seat at the table comes with a vote remains an open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sony forecasts a thirty-billion-yen hit this fiscal year as artificial intelligence datacentres consume the world's memory chip supply.</s> <s>New production lines take twelve months to commission, even with billions in pledged investment, leaving consumer electronics squeezed at the back of the queue.</s> <s>Nintendo's already raised Switch prices, and Sony warns the shortage will outlast the calendar year.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Nigerian study found ninety-four percent of adults knew their sickle cell genotype, but only ten percent could correctly estimate the reproductive risk.</s> <s>Nigeria carries the world's largest sickle cell burden — roughly one hundred and fifty thousand affected births a year — and decades of public messaging have rested on a simplified three-genotype model.</s> <s>Lesser-known compound genotypes are now causing serious disease in couples the screening had cleared.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A canal wall failed overnight in Pakistan's Pakpattan district, flooding twenty-four villages and over a thousand acres of cropland.</s> <s>Punjab's irrigation department arrived fifteen hours late because it has to rent heavy machinery from private contractors, while a hundred villagers tried to plug the breach by hand.</s> <s>Climate adaptation in South Asia increasingly looks like emergency repair on a nineteenth-century canal system meeting twenty-first-century floods.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The International Maritime Organization's net-zero framework survived another negotiation round in London, charging ships three hundred and eighty dollars per tonne of carbon dioxide above the lowest threshold.</s> <s>If adopted, it'd be the first true cross-border carbon price ever agreed — aviation's offset scheme isn't a real price.</s> <s>November's vote needs a two-thirds majority, with Saudi Arabia and the Emirates among the loudest opponents.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>European and Japanese space agencies have signed a Ramses mission agreement to rendezvous with the asteroid Apophis when it skims past Earth in twenty twenty-nine.</s> <s>Apophis will pass inside geostationary orbit at thirty-two thousand kilometres, closer than many of our communications satellites.</s> <s>It's a once-per-generation chance to watch Earth's tidal forces deform a major asteroid in real time, God willing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Manhattan judge has cleared the Aave protocol to move seventy-one million dollars in ether traced back to a North Korean hack.</s> <s>Creditors holding eight hundred and seventy-seven million dollars in terrorism judgments had sought the funds, and the ruling preserves their claim while letting the protocol recover its assets.</s> <s>It's the first major American ruling treating a permissionless decentralised finance protocol as a custodian — the legal fiction that it's just code is breaking down.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Threat researchers have attributed two parallel campaigns — one against Asian government and defence networks, one surveilling Tibetan, Uyghur, and Hong Kong diaspora overseas — to a single Chinese operator.</s> <s>The unification matters... state espionage and transnational repression were treated as the same toolkit by the same hands.</s> <s>Three democracies sanctioned Beijing-linked actors that same week, suggesting the wall between those two problems is finally coming down.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>